---
interface Props {
  kind: 'recovery' | 'ack' | 'fencing' | 'metrics';
}

const { kind } = Astro.props;
const labels = {
  recovery: 'Worker 장애 뒤 pending entry가 회수되고 결과 저장 뒤 XACK되는 흐름',
  ack: '결과 저장 뒤 XACK하는 안전한 처리 순서와 crash window',
  fencing: '오래된 worker의 write를 fencing token으로 거부하는 흐름',
  metrics: 'Queue 운영에서 함께 봐야 하는 네 가지 지표',
} as const;
---

<section class="worker-diagram" aria-label={labels[kind]}>
  {kind === 'recovery' && (
    <div class="worker-diagram__flow">
      <div class="worker-diagram__card worker-diagram__card--queue">
        <span class="worker-diagram__eyebrow">01 · DELIVER</span>
        <strong>Queue</strong>
        <p>새 job을 Worker A에 전달</p>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__card worker-diagram__card--warning">
        <span class="worker-diagram__eyebrow">02 · CRASH</span>
        <strong>Worker A 종료</strong>
        <p>아직 XACK하지 못한 전달</p>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__card worker-diagram__card--pel">
        <span class="worker-diagram__eyebrow">03 · PENDING</span>
        <strong>PEL에 남음</strong>
        <p>“완료”가 아니라 “미확인 전달”</p>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__card worker-diagram__card--success">
        <span class="worker-diagram__eyebrow">04 · RECLAIM</span>
        <strong>Worker B가 회수</strong>
        <p>유휴 시간이 충분히 긴 entry를 재개</p>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__card worker-diagram__card--result">
        <span class="worker-diagram__eyebrow">05 · COMPLETE</span>
        <strong>결과 저장 → XACK</strong>
        <p>durable 결과를 남긴 뒤에만 PEL에서 제거</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  )}

  {kind === 'ack' && (
    <div class="worker-diagram__flow">
      <div class="worker-diagram__card worker-diagram__card--queue">
        <span class="worker-diagram__eyebrow">01</span>
        <strong>job 수신 · attempt 생성</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__card worker-diagram__card--warning">
        <span class="worker-diagram__eyebrow">02</span>
        <strong>Agent · tool 실행</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__note worker-diagram__note--danger">
        <strong>여기서 종료되면</strong>
        <span>PEL에 남아 다른 worker가 회수</span>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__card worker-diagram__card--success">
        <span class="worker-diagram__eyebrow">03</span>
        <strong>결과를 DB에 저장</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__note worker-diagram__note--safe">
        <strong>저장 뒤 종료돼도</strong>
        <span>재전달 시 멱등하게 완료 처리 가능</span>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__card worker-diagram__card--result">
        <span class="worker-diagram__eyebrow">04</span>
        <strong>XACK</strong>
        <p>이제 PEL의 전달 기록을 제거</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  )}

  {kind === 'fencing' && (
    <div class="worker-diagram__flow">
      <div class="worker-diagram__card worker-diagram__card--warning">
        <span class="worker-diagram__eyebrow">ATTEMPT 1 · FENCE 41</span>
        <strong>Worker A가 실행</strong>
        <p>응답이 늦어져 실행 소유권이 불확실해짐</p>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__card worker-diagram__card--success">
        <span class="worker-diagram__eyebrow">ATTEMPT 2 · FENCE 42</span>
        <strong>Worker B가 회수</strong>
        <p>더 새로운 fencing token을 받아 실행</p>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__decision" role="group" aria-label="데이터베이스 write 결정">
        <div>
          <span>늦은 Worker A write</span>
          <strong>fence 41 → 거부</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>현재 Worker B write</span>
          <strong>fence 42 → 허용</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="worker-diagram__caption">DB는 active_fence와 일치하는 attempt의 결과만 기록한다.</p>
    </div>
  )}

  {kind === 'metrics' && (
    <div class="worker-diagram__metrics">
      <div class="worker-diagram__metric worker-diagram__metric--blue">
        <span>새 작업 대기</span>
        <strong>group lag</strong>
        <p>아직 consumer에 전달되지 않은 entry</p>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__metric worker-diagram__metric--red">
        <span>미완료 전달</span>
        <strong>PEL count</strong>
        <p>전달됐지만 XACK되지 않은 entry</p>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__metric worker-diagram__metric--amber">
        <span>복구 지연</span>
        <strong>oldest pending idle</strong>
        <p>가장 오래 멈춰 있는 pending entry</p>
      </div>
      <div class="worker-diagram__metric worker-diagram__metric--green">
        <span>실행 건강도</span>
        <strong>retry · failure · duration</strong>
        <p>run·attempt 지표에서 보는 실행 상태</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  )}
</section>

<style>
  .worker-diagram {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 1.75rem auto;
    color: #293241;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .worker-diagram__flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .worker-diagram__card,
  .worker-diagram__note,
  .worker-diagram__decision,
  .worker-diagram__metric {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  .worker-diagram__card {
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
  }

  .worker-diagram__eyebrow {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    color: #64748b;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.69rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .worker-diagram strong {
    display: block;
    color: #26374d;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .worker-diagram p {
    margin: 0.28rem 0 0;
    color: #52606d;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .worker-diagram__arrow {
    align-self: center;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .worker-diagram__card--queue { background: #eef4ff; border-color: #8baed7; }
  .worker-diagram__card--warning { background: #fffaf0; border-color: #d9aa5c; }
  .worker-diagram__card--pel { background: #fff5f5; border-color: #db8991; }
  .worker-diagram__card--success { background: #f0faf4; border-color: #76b897; }
  .worker-diagram__card--result { background: #f4f7fb; border-color: #9caec4; }

  .worker-diagram__note {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 10rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.45rem 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .worker-diagram__note strong { font-size: 0.84rem; }
  .worker-diagram__note--danger { background: #fff7f7; border-color: #edb1b1; }
  .worker-diagram__note--danger strong { color: #9b2c2c; }
  .worker-diagram__note--safe { background: #f2fbf6; border-color: #a6d9b8; }
  .worker-diagram__note--safe strong { color: #17644d; }

  .worker-diagram__decision {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .worker-diagram__decision > div {
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
  }

  .worker-diagram__decision > div + div {
    border-left: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    background: #f0faf4;
  }

  .worker-diagram__decision span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .worker-diagram__decision > div:first-child strong { color: #9b2c2c; }
  .worker-diagram__decision > div:last-child strong { color: #17644d; }

  .worker-diagram__caption {
    margin-top: 0.15rem !important;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .worker-diagram__metrics {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .worker-diagram__metric {
    min-height: 8.5rem;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .worker-diagram__metric > span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
    color: #52606d;
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .worker-diagram__metric strong {
    font-size: 0.96rem;
  }

  .worker-diagram__metric--blue { background: #eef4ff; border-color: #8baed7; }
  .worker-diagram__metric--red { background: #fff5f5; border-color: #db8991; }
  .worker-diagram__metric--amber { background: #fffaf0; border-color: #d9aa5c; }
  .worker-diagram__metric--green { background: #f0faf4; border-color: #76b897; }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .worker-diagram {
      margin: 1.35rem 0;
    }

    .worker-diagram__card {
      padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem;
    }

    .worker-diagram__note,
    .worker-diagram__decision,
    .worker-diagram__metrics {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .worker-diagram__note {
      gap: 0.2rem;
    }

    .worker-diagram__decision > div + div {
      border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .worker-diagram__metric {
      min-height: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
